d_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":13,"created_at":"2026-08-19T08:30:01Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T10:15:13Z","closed_at":"2026-08-20T10:15:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: 4.7.2-stable [ed1daf0], 4.7.3-rc [cd709b3], 4.7.1-stable [a13da4f]\nNot reproducible in: ~~4.7.1-stable [a13da4f]~~, 4.6.3-stable [a80a06c]\n\n### System information\n\nubuntu-24.04 (github workflow and docker container), Godot v4.7.2 - OpenGL (Compatibility)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen following the template compilation guide for godot to create a github compilation workflow or a docker image that compiles based on build profiles the compilation fails early in the process\n<img width=\"407\" height=\"353\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a9de68d-029f-46cc-9626-51ea046acc03\" />\n\nI was able to verify this error for the `template_debug` and `template_release` targets for the following operating environments\n- Linux\n- Windows\n- Web\n\nOther environments may also be affected. I have not tried.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe MRP contains a minimal dockerfile and compose file to reproduce the bug with 4.7.2-stable\n\n1. Download the MRP\n2. Go to the Releases tab inside this repository and download the source for version 4.7.2 or any other version you desire to test and unpack it to the `godot_src` folder.\n3. open `entrypoint.sh` and choose the to be supposed OS target by uncommenting/commenting lines\n4. run `docker compose up`\n5. Compilation will fail\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThe attached MRP contains a minimal dockerfile that can compile Linux, Windows and Web templates given a build profile. It is set to compile `template_debug` for linux\n\n[Archive.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31214791/Archive.zip)\n\n## Used compilation flags\n\n**Linux**\n```bash\nplatform=linuxbsd target=template_debug arch=x86_64 tools=no build_profile=\"../build_profile.build\"\nplatform=linuxbsd production=yes target=template_release arch=x86_64 tools=no build_profile=\"../build_profile.build\"\n```\n\n**Windows**\n```bash\nplatform=windows target=template_debug tools=no arch=x86_64 build_profile=\"../build_profile.build\"\nplatform=windows production=yes target=template_release tools=no arch=x86_64 build_profile=\"../build_profile.build\"\n```\n\n**Web**\n```bash\nplatform=web target=template_debug threads=no tools=no build_profile=\"../build_profile.build\"\nplatform=web target=template_release threads=no tools=no build_profile=\"../build_profile.build\"\n```","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issue